      assignment: "Write a one-page note for Ridgeway's superintendent. Explain how the rags on the bar screen could affect the clarifiers and the pumps. Describe what the removal efficiency and effluent TSS trend would look like if the slow scraper were the main cause. Say which measurement would separate a scraper problem from an influent problem, and why. Name the checks you would make before recommending any repair.",
